OL,3,GNEWSAPinewood at 90: James Bond, Oscar
OL,4,Awinners and AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FPinewood Studios has helped shape the
OL,7,Fhistory of cinema.
OL,9,FBehind its gates the Avengers have
OL,10,Fassembled, Jedi have mastered the Force
OL,11,Fand James Bond has repeatedly saved the
OL,12,Fworld (and drank a lot of Martinis).
OL,14,FNow it is celebrating its 90th
OL,15,Fanniversary - at a time when the movie
OL,16,Findustry faces huge change.
OL,18,FChief executive officer David Conway
OL,19,Fpoints out about 180 Oscar-winning
OL,20,Ffilms have been shot on the
OL,21,FBuckinghamshire site.
